raits of D.\n- Remaining uncertainty: How much B\u2019s pretentiousness and occasional wrong tone will actually affect crew\u2011resource\u2011management on long\u2011haul flights, especially under sustained stress.\n- What would change my vote: Convincing evidence that Candidate\u202fC\u2019s communication difficulties are minor or can be fully mitigated, or that Candidate\u202fD\u2019s moodiness/hot temper is negligible in practice, would shift my preference toward those candidates.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
